ass=\"badge bg-danger featured-article-badge\">Featured</span>\n\n<div class=\"articleBody\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<div class=\"article-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/index.php/en/8-article-pages/80-gingerbread\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGingerbread House Building Contest\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-info\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"published\" title=\"Published: 05 November 2026\">\n\t<time datetime=\"2026-11-05T20:21:07-08:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t05 November 2026\t</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">It is with our sincerest apologies that we must announce the cancellation of this event, regrettably due to an unforeseen lack of participation that rendered it unfeasible to proceed. We are truly sorry that the level of interest did not meet expectations, and we deeply regret any disappointment this news may cause. Looking forward, we are committed to learning from this outcome and plan to introduce a much simpler and more accessible event next year, aiming to foster broader engagement from everyone. Above all, our most heartfelt apologies go out to those who dedicated their valuable time and effort to prepare something for this occasion; we are genuinely sorry for any inconvenience or wasted work this cancellation causes.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Essensual &amp; Adani</span></p>\n\t\n\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\titemprop=\"blogPost\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BlogPosting\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Featured Tag -->\n\t<span class=\"badge bg-danger featured-article-badge\">Featured</span>\n\n<div class=\"articleBody\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<div class=\"article-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\